{"id": "finqa_dev_174", "split": "dev", "subset_source": "FinQA", "question": "What percentage of Hologic's total contractual obligations, as outlined in the table for September 27, 2008, are due for payment within the next 12 months?", "program_answer": 0.05793160658263424, "original_answer": "5.8%", "company_cik": 859737, "report_year": 2008, "gold_chunk_ids": [53], "trace_id": "f22577c65cfe0d2560349925bba9c20d", "trace_id_static": "743ca52cfe10d612a2bc9f4bd129a773", "session_id": "finqa_dev_174", "final_answer": "To calculate the percentage of Hologic's total contractual obligations due within the next 12 months (less than 1 year) as of September 27, 2008:\n\n* **Less than 1 year obligations:** $156,571 thousand\n* **Total contractual obligations:** $2,702,687 thousand\n\n$$\\text{Percentage} = \\frac{156,571}{2,702,687} \\times 100 \\approx 5.79\\%$$\n\nANSWER: 5.79%", "iterations": 2, "hit_iteration_cap": false, "judge_verdicts": ["loop", "finish"], "trajectory": [{"iteration": 1, "query": "Hologic September 27 2008 contractual obligations table less than 1 year total", "rerank_query": "September 27 2008 contractual obligations table less than 1 year total", "tickers": ["HOLX"], "judge_verdict": "loop", "top_k": [["HOLX_2008_859737", 52, 0.9855361580848694], ["HOLX_2007_859737", 49, 0.8135980367660522], ["HOLX_2009_859737", 106, 0.7760408520698547], ["HOLX_2010_859737", 52, 0.6397755742073059], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 61, 0.5913489460945129], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 58, 0.5855693817138672], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 113, 0.5024176836013794], ["HOLX_2009_859737", 62, 0.45831072330474854], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 132, 0.41321229934692383], ["HOLX_2009_859737", 67, 0.40341487526893616]], "candidates_prerank": [["HOLX_2008_859737", 132], ["HOLX_2010_859737", 66], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 113], ["HOLX_2010_859737", 71], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 61], ["HOLX_2009_859737", 62], ["HOLX_2008_859737", 68], ["HOLX_2015_859737", 90], ["HOLX_2010_859737", 52], ["HOLX_2009_859737", 67], ["HOLX_200