{"id": "finqa_dev_413", "split": "dev", "subset_source": "FinQA", "question": "As of December 31, 2010, what percentage of the net allowance did Citigroup's purchased distressed loan portfolio represent in relation to its carrying amount, which was $392 million?", "program_answer": 0.19642857142857142, "original_answer": "19.6%", "company_cik": 831001, "report_year": 2010, "gold_chunk_ids": [200], "trace_id": "b2aa5744b666f9bd2dd29c00af8e5650", "trace_id_static": "6837a2256f845829d4731f675390c462", "session_id": "finqa_dev_413", "final_answer": "Based on the provided evidence, the carrying amount of Citigroup's purchased distressed loan portfolio at December 31, 2010 was $392 million, net of an allowance of $77 million.\n\nCalculating the percentage of the allowance in relation to this carrying amount:\n$$\\frac{\\$77\\text{ million}}{\\$392\\text{ million}} \\times 100 \\approx 19.64\\%$$\n\nANSWER: 19.64%", "iterations": 1, "hit_iteration_cap": false, "judge_verdicts": ["finish"], "trajectory": [{"iteration": 1, "query": "Citigroup purchased distressed loan portfolio allowance December 31 2010 392 million percentage", "rerank_query": "purchased distressed loan portfolio allowance December 31 2010 392 million percentage", "tickers": ["C"], "judge_verdict": "finish", "top_k": [["C_2010_831001", 200, 0.9966668486595154], ["C_2010_831001", 65, 0.9265204668045044], ["C_2009_831001", 196, 0.9037513136863708], ["C_2015_831001", 214, 0.8447645306587219], ["C_2018_831001", 74, 0.7808746099472046], ["C_2009_831001", 71, 0.7343541383743286], ["C_2008_831001", 200, 0.7227417826652527], ["C_2017_831001", 85, 0.7158851027488708], ["C_2017_831001", 210, 0.6101075410842896], ["C_2009_831001", 72, 0.5907929539680481]], "candidates_prerank": [["C_2010_831001", 65], ["C_2010_831001", 200], ["C_2008_831001", 200], ["C_2009_831001", 196], ["C_2008_831001", 75], ["C_2016_831001", 88], ["C_2010_831001", 4], ["C_2015_831001", 214], ["C_2008_831001", 66], ["C_2010_831001", 123], ["C_2015_