{"id": "finqa_dev_771", "split": "dev", "subset_source": "FinQA", "question": "What percentage of International Paper's industrial packaging sales in 2006 were represented by European industrial packaging net sales?", "program_answer": 0.20304568527918782, "original_answer": "20%", "company_cik": 51434, "report_year": 2007, "gold_chunk_ids": [28, 29], "trace_id": "3ec40e91b40c4c489b1f0dc8b4fc1d88", "trace_id_static": "a8fe9faf1ad48b4e346ecc5339c1e59d", "session_id": "finqa_dev_771", "final_answer": "To find the percentage of International Paper's industrial packaging sales in 2006 represented by European industrial packaging net sales:\n\n* **European Industrial Packaging Sales (2006):** $1,001 million\n* **Total Industrial Packaging Net Sales (2006):** $4,925 million (or $5,111 million based on external sales by major product)\n\nCalculation based on segment net sales:\n$$\\frac{\\$1,001\\text{ million}}{\\$4,925\\text{ million}} \\times 100 \\approx 20.32\\%$$\n\n*(Calculation based on external sales: $\\frac{\\$1,001\\text{ million}}{\\$5,111\\text{ million}} \\times 100 \\approx 19.59\\%$)*\n\nANSWER: 20.32%", "iterations": 1, "hit_iteration_cap": false, "judge_verdicts": ["finish"], "trajectory": [{"iteration": 1, "query": "International Paper 2006 Industrial Packaging sales European industrial packaging net sales", "rerank_query": "2006 Industrial sales European industrial net sales", "tickers": ["IP", "PKG"], "judge_verdict": "finish", "top_k": [["IP_2007_51434", 47, 0.7948887348175049], ["IP_2006_51434", 45, 0.731724739074707], ["IP_2006_51434", 25, 0.6812944412231445], ["IP_2006_51434", 26, 0.5165950655937195], ["IP_2007_51434", 29, 0.45475858449935913], ["IP_2006_51434", 24, 0.42400893568992615], ["IP_2006_51434", 3, 0.35865285992622375], ["IP_2007_51434", 46, 0.34214431047439575], ["IP_2007_51434", 3, 0.29471737146377563], ["IP_2006_51434", 44, 0.2711842656135559]], "candidates_prerank": [["IP_2007_51434", 29], ["IP_2006_51434", 44], ["IP_2005_51434", 23]