{"id": "finqa_dev_478", "split": "dev", "subset_source": "FinQA", "question": "What is the percentage change in the balance of the Prudential Insurance Company of America from 2016 to 2017, as reflected in the estimated cost to replace all such annuities for which Everest Re Group, Ltd. was contingently liable?", "program_answer": -0.012893581876633881, "original_answer": "-1.3%", "company_cik": 1095073, "report_year": 2017, "gold_chunk_ids": [149], "trace_id": "ec7709df5540a7983e9f8f259fdc7e41", "trace_id_static": "57f95bd1b40b048379bd509f400eb0d7", "session_id": "finqa_dev_478", "final_answer": "To find the percentage change in the estimated cost to replace all annuities from The Prudential Insurance Company of America for which the Company was contingently liable from 2016 to 2017:\n\n* **2016 Balance:** $146,507 thousand\n* **2017 Balance:** $144,618 thousand\n\n$$\\text{Percentage Change} = \\frac{144,618 - 146,507}{146,507} \\times 100 = \\frac{-1,889}{146,507} \\times 100 \\approx -1.29\\%$$\n\nANSWER: -1.29%", "iterations": 1, "hit_iteration_cap": false, "judge_verdicts": ["finish"], "trajectory": [{"iteration": 1, "query": "Everest Re Group Prudential Insurance Company of America annuities contingently liable 2016 2017", "rerank_query": "Prudential Insurance Company of America annuities contingently liable 2016 2017", "tickers": ["RE"], "judge_verdict": "finish", "top_k": [["RE_2017_1095073", 149, 0.9925656318664551], ["RE_2016_1095073", 141, 0.976072371006012], ["RE_2018_1095073", 157, 0.9661509990692139], ["RE_2015_1095073", 135, 0.9569889307022095], ["RE_2014_1095073", 131, 0.9399657845497131], ["RE_2017_1095073", 2, 0.9049600958824158], ["RE_2013_1095073", 130, 0.8983086943626404], ["RE_2010_1095073", 131, 0.8884367346763611], ["RE_2012_1095073", 134, 0.8770028948783875], ["RE_2007_1095073", 129, 0.8592063188552856]], "candidates_prerank": [["RE_2012_1095073", 134], ["RE_2006_1095073", 131], ["RE_2013_1095073", 130], ["RE_2017_1095073", 149], ["RE_2010_